      "shortDescription": "Pieralisi Maip designs and manufactures centrifugal separation and extraction equipment. Its official range covers decanter centrifuges, centrifugal separators, olive-oil processing plants and supporting process equipment for industrial and food applications.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official Pieralisi sources identify Pieralisi Maip S.p.A. as an Italian separation-technology manufacturer headquartered in Jesi. The company traces its origins to the workshop established by Adeodato Pieralisi in Monsano in 1888.",
        "The documented portfolio includes decanter centrifuges, manual-, automatic- and nozzle-discharge centrifugal separators, complete olive-oil plants and supporting feed, transfer, washing, crushing, control and analysis equipment. Published applications span environmental treatment, food and beverage, recycling, vegetable oils, mineral fuels and lubricants, chemical and pharmaceutical processing and animal by-products."
      ],
